{
  "title": "NChat Overview",
  "uid": "nchat-overview",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "10s",
  "tags": ["nchat", "mvp", "observability"],
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Service health",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Services up",
      "description": "Number of NChat services currently up (1=up, 0=down).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "up{job=\"nchat-go-services\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Service inventory",
      "description": "Service metadata reported via nchat_service_info.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "service", "desc": false }]
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "filterable": false } },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Time" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "custom.hidden", "value": true }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Value" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "custom.hidden", "value": true }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "nchat_service_info",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} {{version}}",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": { "mode": "columns" }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "job": true,
              "instance": true,
              "component": true,
              "port": true
            },
            "renameByName": {}
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Traffic",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 7 }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP request rate by service",
      "description": "Requests per second per service (all status codes).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 5 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(nchat_http_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP request rate by status",
      "description": "Requests per second broken down by service and HTTP status code.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 5 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (service, status) (rate(nchat_http_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} {{status}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Latency",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16 }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP latency p95 by service",
      "description": "95th percentile request duration per service.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 5 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, service) (rate(nchat_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP latency p50 by service",
      "description": "Median (50th percentile) request duration per service.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 17 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 5 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, service) (rate(nchat_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP latency p99 by service",
      "description": "99th percentile request duration per service.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 17 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 5 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, service) (rate(nchat_http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Errors",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 25 }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "5xx error rate by service",
      "description": "Server-error responses per second per service.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 26 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10 },
          "color": { "fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(nchat_http_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "4xx response rate by service",
      "description": "Client-error responses per second per service.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 26 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10 },
          "color": { "fixedColor": "orange", "mode": "fixed" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (service) (rate(nchat_http_requests_total{status=~\"4..\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error ratio 5xx",
      "description": "Fraction of all requests that returned a 5xx status code.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 26 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.01 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.05 }
            ]
          },
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(nchat_http_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(nchat_http_requests_total[5m])), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "5xx ratio",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Concurrency",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 34 }
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "In-flight requests by service",
      "description": "Number of HTTP requests currently being processed per service.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 35 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (service) (nchat_http_in_flight_requests)",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Tracing",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 43 }
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Tracing — Jaeger",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 44 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Distributed Traces\n\nUse the **Jaeger datasource** in Grafana (Explore → Jaeger) or open **http://localhost:16686** to inspect distributed traces.\n\nServices emit OpenTelemetry spans when `OTEL_ENABLED=true`. Span names follow `<METHOD> <path>` convention.\n\n```bash\nOTEL_ENABLED=true \\\nOTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:4318 \\\ngo run ./cmd/<service>\n```\n\nAuthorisation headers, cookies, and request bodies are **never** recorded in traces."
      }
    }
  ]
}
